# ShardFoundry local-execution hygiene (scoped to edge0-intel/).
# Prevents multi-GB accidents; ledger + scripts + docs stay tracked.
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.npy
*.log
*.err
offload_*/
graft/
graft_probe/
__pycache__/
tmp_surg/
.ignore
*.out
*.log
*.err
meta_tensors.txt
parts*.txt
sweep_status.json
models/*.gguf
!models/*/README.md
